# The global pnpm `minimum-release-age` guard (7 days) blocks deepmerge-ts
# 8.0.1, which is the only release that fixes GHSA-ggr8-5vv4-36mx (high).
# @prisma/config pins deepmerge-ts at an exact version, so the pnpm override
# in package.json is the only way to reach the patched line. Scoped to this
# one package on purpose — the guard still applies to everything else.
minimum-release-age-exclude[]=deepmerge-ts
